 next year and I&#039;m wondering if there are brides out there that planned the wedding themselves without using a wedding planner?  If you had to do it over again, would you hire a wedding planner for the price around $3,000 that could go toward photography or flowers?\n\n\nI&#039;m debating to whether or not to hire a wedding planner.\n\n\nThank you.","Attachments":[],"Id":1856424,"PostDate":1403334541,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi All,<br><br>\nI'm planning to get married on Grace Bay in April next year and I'm wondering if there are brides out there that planned the wedding themselves without using a wedding planner?  If you had to do it over again, would you hire a wedding planner for the price around $3,000 that could go toward photography or flowers?<br><br>\nI'm debating to whether or not to hire a wedding planner.<br><br>\nThank you.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"apattanasiri@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"69.14.253.252","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403333927,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"FromLV","Id":278625,"Name":"FromLV","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"78.129.250.119","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77374,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"78d34a7083a5ccd9e43887e72c3f2f87","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Grace Bay is a fantastic place, surely you will enjoy but i advice you to hire a wedding planner so that you can enjoy your wedding ceremony otherwise it will become stressful.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Because there are certain things like arrangement, food , decoration, most importantly guest,so if you hire them then they will take care of all the arrangements.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1856428,"PostDate":1403353824,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Grace Bay is a fantastic place, surely you will enjoy but i advice you to hire a wedding planner so that you can enjoy your wedding ceremony otherwise it will become stressful.<\/p>\n<p>Because there are certain things like arrangement, food , decoration, most importantly guest,so if you hire them then they will take care of all the arrangements.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"raiden1313clark@gmail.com","IpAddress":"193.150.8.94","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403338580,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Qiana1Parker","Id":278626,"Name":"Qiana1Parker","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.224.203.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDele