=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Akittrell,\n \n I am a St. Thomas Bride getting married at the Wyndham.. if you have any questions you can PM me :)&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Thanks I really appreciate it!","Attachments":[],"Id":380180,"PostDate":1216076416,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>09bride<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Akittrell,<br \/> <br \/> I am a St. Thomas Bride getting married at the Wyndham.. if you have any questions you can PM me <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Thanks I really appreciate it!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/cache\/ac28bc59fb.png\">http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/cache\/ac28bc59fb.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wUBKFOA\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...FOA\/weight.png<\/a><br><br><span>The below website is a great tool! It's really helped me in my quest to lose weight and live a healthier life!<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.thedailyplate.com\/images\/promos\/promo_01.jpg\">http:\/\/img.thedailyplate.com\/images\/promos\/promo_01.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"alkittrell2@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1215224899,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210322.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":77,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akittrell","Id":210322,"Name":"akittrell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19683,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"08206b05aa364c0c35e15f99198cba2b","RawContent":"akittrell,\n Tho I realize you are interested in all inclusive, you may want to consider other alternatives as the hotel route seems to be more expensive over all. You have lots of options in STT! You may even want to consider a villa and have your private wedding right there! Ck out: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.mclaughlinanderson.com\"&gt;Caribbean Villas: Caribbean Villa Rentals by McLaughlin Anderson Villas Virgin Islands&lt;\/a&gt; Plenty of villas to choose from! How many people guests do you expect for your wedding? This number can also play a roll in your planning!\n Good Luck in your search!\n BTW, I have worked with April prior to her going to Frenchman&#039;s Reef! She is a very nice person! A wonderful friend.....\n Hope you don&#039;t mind my input!","Attachments":[],"Id":385526,"PostDate":1216404656,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                akittrell,<br \/> Tho I realize you are interested in all inclusive, you may want to consider other alternatives as the hotel route seems to be more expensive over all. You have lots of options in STT! You may even want to consider a villa and have your private wedding right there! Ck out: <a href='http:\/\/www.mclaughlinanderson.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Caribbean Villas: Caribbean Villa Rentals by McLaughlin Anderson Villas Virgin Islands<\/a> Plenty of villas to choose from! How many people guests do you expect for your wedding? This number can also play a roll in your planning!<br \/> Good Luck in your search!<br \/> BTW, I have worked with April prior to her going to Frenchman's Reef! She is a very nice person! A wonderful friend.....<br \/> Hope you don't mind my input!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/farm3.static.flickr.com\/2267\/2363959710_058a8dc807_m.jpg\">http:\/\/farm3.static.flickr.com\/2267\/...8a8dc807_m.jpg<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingstheislandway.com\">www.weddingstheislandway.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mclaughlinanderson.com\">www.mclaughlinanderson.com<\/a><br><span>Stone Cottage and Rockworks VillasSt. Thomas, US Virgin Islands<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sherriloumerritt@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1203232672,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208563.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sherri","Id":208563,"Name":"sherri","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19683,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a96e5b8d00c9bc6f51f936539ef17ee7","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;sherri&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;akittrell,\n Tho I realize you are interested in all inclusive, you may want to consider other alternatives as the hotel route seems to be more expensive over all. You have lots of options in STT! You may even want to consider a villa and have your private wedding right there! Ck out: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.mclaughlinanderson.com\"&gt;Caribbean Villas: Caribbean Villa Rentals by McLaughlin Anderson Villas Virgin Islands&lt;\/a&gt; Plenty of villas to choose from! How many people guests do you expect for your wedding? This number can also play a roll in your planning!\n Good Luck in your search!\n BTW, I have worked with April prior to her going to Frenchman&#039;s Reef! She is a very nice person! A wonderful friend.....\n Hope you don&#039;t mind my input!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Thanks for the advise, but as of yesterday we&#039;ve decided to go with Jamaica. We are trying to book Sandals Whitehouse today! The AI option just seems to be the best and easiest way for us to go. Thanks again!","Attachments":[],"Id":385731,"PostDate":1216415040,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>sherri<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">akittrell,<br \/> Tho I realize you are interested in all inclusive, you may want to consider other alternatives as the hotel route seems to be more expensive over all. You have lots of options in STT! You may even want to consider a villa and have your private wedding right there! Ck out: <a href='http:\/\/www.mclaughlinanderson.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Caribbean Villas: Caribbean Villa Rentals by McLaughlin Anderson Villas Virgin Islands<\/a> Plenty of villas to choose from! How many people guests do you expect for your wedding? This number can also play a roll in your planning!<br \/> Good Luck in your search!<br \/> BTW, I have worked with April prior to her going to Frenchman's Reef! She is a very nice person! A wonderful friend.....<br \/> Hope you don't mind my input!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Thanks for the advise, but as of yesterday we've decided to go with Jamaica. We are trying to book Sandals Whitehouse today! The AI option just seems to be the best and easiest way for us to go. Thanks again!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/cache\/ac28bc59fb.png\">http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/cache\/ac28bc59fb.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wUBKFOA\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...FOA\/weight.png<\/a><br><br><span>The below website is a great tool! It's really helped me in my quest to lose weight and live a healthier life!<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.thedailyplate.com\/images\/promos\/promo_01.jpg\">http:\/\/img.thedailyplate.com\/images\/promos\/promo_01.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"alkittrell2@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1215224899,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210322.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":77,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akittrell","Id":210322,"Name":"akittrell","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":23,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
