{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":1,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":341,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1805697,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":274090,"Name":"littlebride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274090.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1381253846,"LastPoster":{"Id":274090,"Name":"littlebride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274090.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":25,"Preview":{"Id":1805697,"PostDate":1381253846,"PostContent":"Hi all, I am planning to have a destination wedding in 2014 at Turks and Caicos. We decide to pay...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shirleylq@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.162.183.152","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1381252621,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274090.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"littlebride","Id":274090,"Name":"littlebride","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75293,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"458ed13dcd8784ea14890838241016e6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi all,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;I am planning to have a destination wedding in 2014 at Turks and Caicos. We decide to pay everything ourselves (including accommodation for families), but the resort\/villa there seems to be pricey, any suggestion or tips? Also,&amp;nbsp;I have no clue how to distribute my budget.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;After searching&amp;nbsp;online, it seems like the following additional cost&amp;nbsp;is common:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;flowers: 300-1000&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;wedding planner: 1000-2500&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;food: 25-50 per person&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;photography: 1000-4000&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Our family will stay for 5 days, and we are expecting about 16 guests.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Could you kindly share some information about the costs of your wedding, and any hidden costs I may overlook?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Many many thanks and Yay for my first post :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1805697,"PostDate":1381253846,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi all,<\/p> <p>I am planning to have a destination wedding in 2014 at Turks and Caicos. We decide to pay everything ourselves (including accommodation for families), but the resort\/villa there seems to be pricey, any suggestion or tips? Also,\u00a0I have no clue how to distribute my budget.<\/p> <p>After searching\u00a0online, it seems like the following additional cost\u00a0is common:<\/p> <p>flowers: 300-1000<\/p> <p>wedding planner: 1000-2500<\/p> <p>food: 25-50 per person<\/p> <p>photography: 1000-4000<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Our family will stay for 5 days, and we are expecting about 16 guests.\u00a0<\/p> <p>Could you kindly share some information about the costs of your wedding, and any hidden costs I may overlook?<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Many many thanks and Yay for my first post <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shirleylq@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.162.183.152","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1381252621,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274090.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"littlebride","Id":274090,"Name":"littlebride","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"75293","Title":"budget for destination wedding in Turks and Caicos 2014","LastPostDate":1381253846},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
