t I cant find any wedding reviews! Anyone been there or know any info on this resort? Thanks :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1616654,"PostDate":1336405345,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Im debating on getting married in St.Lucia or Jamaica! I cant decide, however Coconut Bay resort seems nice, but I cant find any wedding reviews! Anyone been there or know any info on this resort? Thanks <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelly_judges_035@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1329769894,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251675.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jamaicanmecrazy","Id":251675,"Name":"Jamaicanmecrazy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67350,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"049b1ef515be4aaa96112fd0f6d11a49","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Did you try trip advisor for reviews as well?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; http:\/\/www.tripadvisor.com\/Hotel_Review-g652398-d534892-Reviews-Coconut_Bay_Resort_Spa-Vieux_Fort_St_Lucia.html&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1616953,"PostDate":1336433626,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Did you try trip advisor for reviews as well?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.tripadvisor.com\/Hotel_Review-g652398-d534892-Reviews-Coconut_Bay_Resort_Spa-Vieux_Fort_St_Lucia.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.tripadvis...t_St_Lucia.html<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carlydorazio@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.92.56.95","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1177552500,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207375.jpg?_r=1414982962","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"boscobel","Id":207375,"Name":"boscobel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67350,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"41e3d4113a12a4947f2d9d3cf5d834a7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am in the same decision! I have chose St Lucia because it is my dream, but I am now choosing between Sandals and Coconut Bay.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1654506,"PostDate":1345435168,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am in the same decision! I have chose St Lucia because it is my dream, but I am now choosing between Sandals and Coconut Bay.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brittany_ashby@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1345434889,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259359.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BASHBY86","Id":259359,"Name":"BASHBY86","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67350,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c5d34466dd883c8adac713ebaf5c4571","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m getting married in St. Lucia at Windjammer Landing this November. I &#039;ve been to St. Lucia 3 times and my fiance is from the Island. I haven&#039;t actually stayed at Coconut Bay but I do know that it&#039;s located on the windward side of the island. This means that the waves on the beach will be a bit rougher than those located on the western side. That would be a good thing if you&#039;re into&amp;nbsp;windsurfing.&amp;nbsp;The hotel itself seems to have good reviews and it was one I considered because it&#039;s so family friendly.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Coconut Bay Resort is located in Vieux Fort so you&#039;ll be close to the international airport. Hotels on the western side can take approximately an hour ride to get to from the airport. There is an option of taking a helicopter ride to the other&amp;nbsp;side of the island if you decide to stay there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; If you stay at Coconut Bay you&#039;ll also be located close to Soufriere and the pitons. That&#039;s a good thing if you want to go on any excursions.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Let me know if you need any additional information on other hotels on the island. I&#039;d be happy to help!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1656459,"PostDate":1345833788,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm getting married in St. Lucia at Windjammer Landing this November. I 've been to St. Lucia 3 times and my fiance is from the Island. I haven't actually stayed at Coconut Bay but I do know that it's located on the windward side of the island. This means that the waves on the beach will be a bit rougher than those located on the western side. That would be a good thing if you're into\u00a0windsurfing.\u00a0The hotel itself seems to have good reviews and it was one I considered because it's so family friendly.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Coconut Bay Resort is located in Vieux Fort so you'll be close to the international airport. Hotels on the western side can take approximately an hour ride to get to from the airport. There is an option of taking a helicopter ride to the other\u00a0side of the island if you decide to stay there.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> If you stay at Coconut Bay you'll also be located close to Soufriere and the pitons. That's a good thing if you want to go on any excursions.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Let me know if you need any additional information on other hotels on the island. I'd be happy to help!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dino_size_fries@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1240390284,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216928.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mpresid","Id":216928,"Name":"Mpresid","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67350,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0a7d7ef3b07167008c77530b48a2f38e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am also debating on Coconut Bay. Does anyone have a wedding review to share?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1742350,"PostDate":1365137689,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am also debating on Coconut Bay. Does anyone have a wedding review to share?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"backyyuen@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.232.87.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1363389265,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267403.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Backy","Id":267403,"Name":"Backy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67350,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"300f46cf2a2a7432017d402e1e9ae506","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello everybody!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Coconut Bay was the resort the FI and I absolutely loved... but couldn&#039;t justify asking our guests to spend $2000 to attend.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Like 90% of our guests will be flying from Toronto, Ontario but any quote we looked into for November 2014 was outrageously priced.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; It doesn&#039;t seem to be a popular resort on this website, which is unfortunate because it seems perfect.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are giving our TAs a list of our top 5 resorts this fall, and Coconut Bay will be on it.&amp;nbsp; If the quotes come back in a reasonable price range, it might be the one we choose!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1762317,"PostDate":1369856555,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello everybody!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Coconut Bay was the resort the FI and I absolutely loved... but couldn't justify asking our guests to spend $2000 to attend.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Like 90% of our guests will be flying from Toronto, Ontario but any quote we looked into for November 2014 was outrageously priced.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> It doesn't seem to be a popular resort on this website, which is unfortunate because it seems perfect.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are giving our TAs a list of our top 5 resorts this fall, and Coconut Bay will be on it.\u00a0 If the quotes come back in a reasonable price range, it might be the one we choose!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cassielalexander@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.49.132","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1368240865,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269486.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CGervaisToBe","Id":269486,"Name":"CGervaisToBe","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"67350","Title":"St. Lucia Coconut Bay Resort wedding?! Please Help!!","LastPostDate":1369856555},"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
